date-released: 2026-08-09
keywords:
  - Erdős–Straus conjecture
  - Egyptian fractions
  - reproducible research
  - mathematical audit
  - parameter compatibility
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, scope-limited arithmetic audit of the compatibility between
  square-free and lattice parameters in the ED2 construction of Dyachenko,
  arXiv:2511.07465v1. The repository does not claim a proof or disproof of
  the Erdős–Straus conjecture.
references:
  - type: article
    authors:
      - family-names: Dyachenko
    title: "On the Erdős–Straus conjecture"
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.07465"
